OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pays #6k to family after
OL,4,Amissed education
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has paid a family #6,000 in
OL,7,Fcompensation after a child with special
OL,8,Feducational needs missed out on nearly
OL,9,Ftwo years of education.
OL,11,FThe missed time was between June 2024
OL,12,Fand June 2026, the Local Government and
OL,13,FSocial Care Ombudsman (LGO) found,
OL,14,Fother than a "very small amount" in
OL,15,Fsummer 2025.
OL,17,FThe child's mother was then put to
OL,18,F"additional time, trouble and
OL,19,Funcertainty" by West Berkshire Council
OL,20,Fas she tried to resolve the problems,
OL,21,Fwith her right of appeal "significant
OL,22,Fdelayed".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
